rs in Japan.\n", "short_description": "The Australian Open VR app is your ticket to the best immersive and interactive experience from the Rod Laver Arena. Content available only for users in Japan.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "748208292787655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568674_748208299454321_9199275796024111845_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P6Flmbv8OaMQ7kNvwEeg5Rr&_nc_oc=AdqD440GK3EuaREvw2PUi_8HSh_yR6102qsWAc2va6RH8GugXhu__OjHMtdNr3UR4VU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL_aZ5hqhc7WJ4nAU6qa1WLkCph2Ve5YhFcFCvoO_japg&oe=6AA54239"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "704643830420157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230051_704643833753490_981048534016631306_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rQ4ElU-lR_gQ7kNvwEMT8Wd&_nc_oc=AdogiumTi1SOhMNRjx028qn0tI5HgMUPG_Db5H-qT1aMlEtXmv4lSCwkq0xCtjXbSd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKiANmwyDxKj-0FlgwlSO47k-Hf1xHmO_kLmkVBtIrzHg&oe=6AA56D09"}, {"file_name": "Square.png", "id": "483520132656129", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75666286_483520139322795_3526818540801169626_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K4gAkw8_qCEQ7kNvwGX_j19&_nc_oc=Adr2X8PZAbhxPZrJDAtuESBL-6L1ypjP0CcGCxIrMTShDTdLnlfo19T6TAVGFFcOVYA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLz8NltTyAbTyFjXdbcHZQtxWtwDtYCt9txLCVQA0gW6Q&oe=6AA570EE"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "426648561976328", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_426648565309661_6996016450691187172_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=89mbNYQxisoQ7kNvwFuUbrN&_nc_oc=AdqKdahrvwzr8cRGiuCv-vB3QpCRkPbO80KYiRGfVwwmOyLpiEuomHUCYAf88PGy7AU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-s